{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_67_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_67","textTraditional":"唐因隋舊，以三省長官為宰相，已而又以他官參議，而稱號不一，出於臨時，最後乃有同品、平章之名，然其為職業則一也。作宰相表。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_67_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_67","textTraditional":"卷六十一　宰相表上","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_67_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_67","textTraditional":"卷六十二　宰相表中","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tan_duong_67_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tan_duong_67","textTraditional":"卷六十三　宰相表下","sentenceOrder":4}],"overrides":{}}